      "type": "explain",
      "id": "e1",
      "title": "Watch out",
      "body": "-ent (ils/elles) is silent: ils parlent sounds like il parle. Listen for the link: ils habitent is eel-zah-BEET, with a z, while il habite is ee-lah-BEET. Also note -ons (nous) and -ez (vous) are always said."
